		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>voici ma configuration pgpool :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code> node_id |   hostname   | port | status | lb_weight |  role
---------+--------------+------+--------+-----------+---------
 0       | 172.31.8.214 | 5432 | 2      | 0.333333  | primary
