2014-02-13 17:55:05 LOG:   pid 26055: DB node id: 0 backend pid: 7876 statement:  DISCARD ALL
2014-02-13 17:55:05 LOG:   pid 26055: DB node id: 1 backend pid: 2289 statement:  DISCARD ALL
