2014-02-13 17:55:12 LOG:   pid 26040: DB node id: 1 backend pid: 2318 statement:  DISCARD ALL
2014-02-13 17:58:14 LOG:   pid 26032: connect_inet_domain_socket: select() timed out. retrying...
